OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over crash between
OL,4,Aambulance and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a crash
OL,7,Finvolving an ambulance and a car in
OL,8,FBradford.
OL,10,FPolice were called by the ambulance
OL,11,Fservice to the scene at Whetley Hill at
OL,12,Fabout 16:05 BST on Wednesday, according
OL,13,Fto West Yorkshire Police.
OL,15,FA 26-year-old man, the driver of the
OL,16,Fcar, was arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fdriving without due care and for
OL,18,Fpossession of class B drugs, a force
OL,19,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
